Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another adorable companion of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is so sublime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I like that part of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She has such a wide interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0B088A&}No way, that's lewd!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't like those?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So she is into those.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They look good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just for a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So she like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looks good in it. {there is a pun, but I can't be bothered}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She has good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could watch her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since I have the ears, might as well add the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:02:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah if you can put it in your...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I put this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I don't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she understands just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is to see whether I am wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I just have to put it in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's finally doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:01.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came! {why are these girls so intense all the time, on drugs or soemthing}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to put it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I just grab it with my hand like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It went it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.39,0:03:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It goes in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The big one's left to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is she going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can she? Can she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:31.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was great.
